[gd_scene load_steps=1 format=3]

; Placeholder shop pose for the Alchemist. The scene is empty on purpose: a mod scene cannot hold a
; SpineSprite (see AlchemistCode/Character/SpineModel.cs), thus AlchemistMerchant adds the model
; after BaseLib turns this root into an NMerchantCharacter. See SpineScenePatch for the wiring.
;
; The shop reuses the combat skeleton and plays its relaxed_loop, the same way every base game
; character does. It needs a rig of its own only if the shop art should differ from combat.

[node name="AlchemistMerchant" type="Node2D"]
